              {
                "text": "In a practice project, a form showed the wrong error message after validation failed. I was responsible for finding the cause. I reproduced the problem, traced it to an incorrect condition, and added a regression test before fixing it. The test passed, and the correct message appeared for the case we had reproduced. I learned how useful a small, repeatable example can be.",
