              },
              {
                "text": "I would start by saying that AI can be very useful at work. First of all, it can save time by automating routine tasks. On top of that, it can help people come up with ideas faster and explore information more efficiently. That being said, AI can make mistakes, so we should always verify the results. Overall, I think AI should support people, not replace them.",
                "lang": "en-US"
              },
              {
                "text": "I used the STAR framework to describe a difficult release: I explained the situation, my task, the actions I took, and the final result.",
